docs\reports\astra-trial\d5\codex.log-1847-3:## kinematic capsule in a physics space that belongs to the world (terrain/world_space.gd, built by the landscape),
docs\reports\astra-trial\d5\codex.log-1848-4:## so he walks on the terrain, stands on a plot's own ground inside the plot, and stops at fences, trees, rocks, walls
docs\reports\astra-trial\d5\codex.log-1849-5:## and rails. He is in no pack's physics space and no pack can see him: the packs are untouched.
